  "Adjusted Corporate Unallocated Expense excluding adjusted Kensho expense ($11m): $33m (Exhibit 8).",
  "Indices operating profit attributable to the Company $99m; adjusted OP attributable (Adjusted Net Operating Profit) $101m (NCI $37m).",
  "Prior-year (Q2-17) columns restated for ASU 2017-07 (pension); balance-sheet cash line now includes restricted cash.",
  "Organic: Ratings acquisition (1), MI acquisitions (3), Corporate acquisition (5).",
  "Intersegment royalty charged by Ratings to Market Intelligence: $26m.",
  "cfpub capex and nci_dist recorded as positive cash costs (release prints them in brackets). fcf_items signed as printed (added to FCF to reach FCF excluding certain items).",
  "rev_type key ELIM = intersegment elimination; CORP = Corporate revenue.",
  "py_seg = Q2-17 comparative on the 2018 basis: total OP 668 vs 677 as reported (pension reclass); unallocated 36 vs 30; adjusted OP 706 vs 715."
